# --- Note ---
# data/, img/, rdf/ and docs/ are part of the reproducible archive.

# --- Generated SQL drop-ins ---
# sql/IPSDatedSites.sql IS the goldstandard and is tracked: it is what gets
# cited, diffed and blamed. What lands here is derived from it by
# py/make_sql.py — the ColdFusion drop-in and the psql form. Committing them
# would create a second copy of the model that can drift without anyone
# noticing which one produced a given export.
sql/generated/

# --- This repository ---
# rdf/, img/ and docs/ are generated but ARE part of the archive:
# they are the deliverable and must be diffable. Do not ignore them.
# The SVGs are byte-stable (SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH + fixed svg.hashsalt), so a
# rebuild without a content change leaves git status clean.

README-PATCH.md